// A minor pentatonic, box 4 (index at fret 12) up and down, then box 5 at frets 2-5 (the same shape
// sounds an octave up at frets 14-17) up and down, in 8ths. lf 2 = index (1) ... lf 5 = pinky (4).
\title "A minor pentatonic, boxes 4 and 5"
\tempo 100
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
